Laya System 1 model bundle

Upstream model files: Convai Innovations / Nandakishor M
Source: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
Runtime: https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

This bundle redistributes unmodified official model snapshot files in a
lossless gzip container. The upstream revision and per-file identities are
recorded in manifest.json and source-lock.json. The upstream README and
source files retain their original contents and notices upon restoration.

Compression/restoration, Windows testing, and packaging scripts are supplied
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. This packaging project is independent
of and is not an endorsement by the upstream authors.
